## DETAIL LEVEL RULES

### Functions/Methods:
- Include: signature with types, return type, one-line description
- Format: `def method_name(param: Type) -> ReturnType: """Description"""`
- Include ALL public methods AI might call

### Properties:
- Include: `@property` decorator, return type, description
- Format: `@property def name(self) -> Type: """Description"""`

### Attributes:
- Include: `attribute_name: Type` for public attributes
- Only include attributes AI needs to know about

### Async Methods:
- Include: `async def` prefix, same rules as regular methods
- Format: `async def method(self) -> ReturnType: """Description"""`

### Classes:
- Include: class name, one-line purpose, ALL public methods/properties
- Group related classes (Base classes, Manager classes, etc.)

### Events:
- Include: ALL event constants, how to listen/emit
- Format: `EVENT_NAME = "event_name"`

### Integration:
- Include: EXACT patterns for DI, plugin registration, settings
- Show the code AI would write to use the package

### Configuration:
- Include: EXACT JSON structure for plugin.json
- Include all required and optional fields

## WHAT TO EXCLUDE
- ❌ Implementation examples
- ❌ Usage tutorials
- ❌ Verbose explanations
- ❌ Best practices
- ❌ Troubleshooting
- ❌ Architecture diagrams
- ❌ Philosophy sections
- ❌ Multiple examples
- ❌ Code comments from source
- ❌ Human-oriented content

